  "description": "Life was never easy for Finn. After her dad left and her mom passed away, she raised herself and her little brother on her own. And when her beloved boss is hospitalized, she takes responsibility for the bookstore she calls home. But the return of the owner’s estranged son throws a wrench in the works. Finn’s opposite, Cormac is rough where she’s sweet, and he knows how to push all of her buttons. But even as the two clash, there’s more to Cormac than meets eye… is this the change Finn needs in her life?\nSource: Tapas",
